  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing women&apos;s access to employment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project will contribute to the increased participation of women in the labour market in the Kosovo and Albania through targeted advocacy in fighting gender discrimination, promoting decent jobs and implementing gender-friendly country strategies that improve the presence of women in the labour market. This will be achieved through increase of the CSO&apos;s influence on policy making processess; build capacities to promote women economic empowerment &amp; public awareness.</narrative>
  </description>
